<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
  <title>Founders — AQUIPLEX</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Meet the founders of AQUIPLEX, the AI company building Aqua AI.">
  <link rel="icon" href="/logo/favicon.ico" sizes="any">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/platform.css">
</head>
<body class="px-page">

  <%- include("partials/nav") %>

  <section class="px-page-hero center">
    <div class="px-container">
      <div class="px-eyebrow">Founders</div>
      <h1>The team behind AQUIPLEX.</h1>
      <p>AQUIPLEX is built by a small founding team working toward one idea: AI that understands the context of your world. Aqua AI is what we are building to get there.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main style="padding-bottom:clamp(64px,11vw,96px);">
    <div class="px-container">
      <div class="px-founder-grid">

        <div class="px-founder">
          <div class="name">Chhanda Prabal Das</div>
          <div class="role">Co-Founder &amp; Chief Executive Officer</div>
          <div class="desc">
            The original mind behind AQUIPLEX. Chhanda is a student and entrepreneur who has worked on multiple early-stage startups, including Uniqence and Acodet. His experience building products from scratch shaped the company&rsquo;s vision: to build the world&rsquo;s most context-aware AI, starting with Aqua AI.
          </div>
          <div class="links">
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/chhanda.pr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/chhanda-prabal-das-7198a0280" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="px-founder">
          <div class="name">Ananya Prabal Das</div>
          <div class="role">Co-Founder &amp; Chief Operating Officer</div>
          <div class="desc">
            Ananya runs daily operations at AQUIPLEX and drives the development of Aqua AI. He plays a key role in turning ideas into real features &mdash; working across the full stack, from the engine that carries a person&rsquo;s context between conversations to the app people use every day.
          </div>
          <div class="links">
            <a href="https://www.instagram.com/ananya.p.r.a" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram</a>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ananya-prabal-das-024293383" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="px-sec-head center" style="margin:88px auto 0; max-width:640px; text-align:center;">
        <div class="px-eyebrow">Our vision</div>
        <h2>Build the world&rsquo;s most context-aware AI.</h2>
        <p>Our mission is to create AI that truly understands your digital world. Aqua AI, our personal thinking system, is where we pursue it today.</p>
        <div class="px-btn-row center" style="margin-top:28px;">
          <a href="<%= PLAY_STORE_URL %>" class="px-btn px-btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Download Aqua AI on Google Play (opens in a new tab)">Download Aqua AI</a>
          <a href="/about" class="px-btn px-btn-secondary">About AQUIPLEX</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <%- include("partials/footer") %>

</body>
</html>
